---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ContinueReading from '../components/ContinueReading';
import { getGameBySlug } from '../lib/content';
const seasons = getGameBySlug('seasons');
---
<BaseLayout active="home">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <div class="kicker">Archive / Memory / Lake</div>
      <h1>进入<br />锈湖档案</h1>
      <p>不是攻略站，而是一套按作品、时间、人物与线索重新组织的剧情阅读器。现在已有两套完整阅读档案：Cube Escape: Seasons 与 Cube Escape: The Lake；可以从剧情阅读、Lore Network 或全站搜索任意入口开始，再沿结构化关联继续探索。</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button" href="/read/seasons/spring-1964">从 Seasons 开始</a>
        <a class="button-ghost" href="/search">全站搜索</a>
        <a class="button-ghost" href="/network">探索关系网</a>
        <a class="button-ghost" href="/progress">设置游玩进度</a>
      </div>
      <ContinueReading client:load />
    </div>
    <div class="hero-file">
      <article class="file-card">
        <div class="kicker">Case File 01</div>
        <div class="stamp">OPEN</div>
        <h2>{seasons?.title.zhHans ?? 'Cube Escape: Seasons'}</h2>
        <div class="rule"></div>
        <div class="file-meta">
          <div><div class="muted">STATUS</div><b>STORY READY</b></div>
          <div><div class="muted">SEARCH</div><b>FULL ARCHIVE</b></div>
          <div><div class="muted">NETWORK</div><b>RELATIONS</b></div>
          <div><div class="muted">SPOILER</div><b>PROGRESS AWARE</b></div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="home-grid" aria-label="探索入口">
    <a class="home-tile" href="/games"><div class="kicker">01</div><b>按游戏阅读</b><span>Seasons 与 The Lake 已开放完整阅读路径。</span></a>
    <a class="home-tile" href="/search"><div class="kicker">02</div><b>全站搜索</b><span>搜索剧情正文、人物、概念、地点、事件与关系，同时遵循防剧透进度。</span></a>
    <a class="home-tile" href="/network"><div class="kicker">03</div><b>Lore Network</b><span>从结构化关系继续探索，不靠视觉邻近猜测关联。</span></a>
    <a class="home-tile" href="/progress"><div class="kicker">04</div><b>防剧透进度</b><span>搜索、关系网、完整档案和阅读器共享同一套本地进度门槛。</span></a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
